1
00:00:12,639 --> 00:00:16,153
Glass on the front and glass on the back
正面是玻璃，背面也是玻璃

2
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:20,053
A ribbon of metal, graphite and black
一圈金属边框，石墨般的黑

3
00:00:20,359 --> 00:00:23,910
Thin as a card, it slips out of sight
薄如卡片，一放就不见踪影

4
00:00:24,398 --> 00:00:27,636
One little key mark catching the light
一枚小小的钥匙标，映着光

5
00:00:27,636 --> 00:00:33,504
Quiet by design, no edges to show
低调是设计，不露一丝棱角

6
00:00:35,537 --> 00:00:42,714
Everything that matters stays down below
真正重要的，都藏在深处

7
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,240
Scan it, sign it, send it
扫码，签名，发送

8
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:48,160
Not a single wire
一根线都不用

9
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,000
Read it before you mean it
先看清，再确认

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,663
Every word in plain type
每个字都明明白白

11
00:00:52,663 --> 00:00:54,539
Keep your keys at home
私钥只留在你身边

12
00:00:54,539 --> 00:00:56,477
Only the signatures go
出门的只有签名

13
00:00:56,477 --> 00:01:00,575
Twenty-four words the internet will never know
二十四个助记词，网络永远无从得知

14
00:01:00,575 --> 00:01:03,436
One key (OneKey), all yours
一把钥匙（OneKey），完全属于你

15
00:01:03,436 --> 00:01:07,584
Hold it, sign it, go
握住它，签下它，出发

16
00:01:11,253 --> 00:01:14,612
Four secure elements, EAL six plus
四颗安全芯片，EAL 6+

17
00:01:14,612 --> 00:01:18,211
Bank-card silicon, so you don't have to trust
银行卡级芯片，无需盲目信任

18
00:01:18,211 --> 00:01:22,231
A camera on the back that only reads light
背面的摄像头只读取光

19
00:01:22,231 --> 00:01:26,232
QR in, QR out, and nothing online
二维码进，二维码出，全程不联网

20
00:01:26,232 --> 00:01:29,770
Contract says "approve all"? SignGuard says wait
合约要你“全部授权”？SignGuard 说：等一下

21
00:01:29,770 --> 00:01:33,350
Clear signing in words, not hex on a plate
用文字清楚签名，而不是一堆十六进制

22
00:01:33,350 --> 00:01:37,009
Touch to unlock it, a PIN if you must
指纹解锁，必要时再用 PIN

23
00:01:37,009 --> 00:01:41,351
Too many wrong guesses, it wipes itself to dust
猜错太多次，它会自毁清空

24
00:01:41,351 --> 00:01:45,012
It's not just your coins anymore
守护的不再只是你的币

25
00:01:45,012 --> 00:01:48,209
It's the key to every door
它是打开每一扇门的钥匙

26
00:01:48,209 --> 00:01:52,430
FIDO in your pocket, passkeys, no passwords to type
口袋里的 FIDO，通行密钥，不必再输密码

27
00:01:52,430 --> 00:01:57,751
Tap it once and you're in, no phishing link tonight
轻点一下即可登录，今晚没有钓鱼链接

28
00:01:59,036 --> 00:02:00,820
Keep your keys at home
私钥只留在你身边

29
00:02:00,820 --> 00:02:02,817
Only the signatures go
出门的只有签名

30
00:02:02,817 --> 00:02:06,476
Twenty-four words the internet will never know
二十四个助记词，网络永远无从得知

31
00:02:06,476 --> 00:02:09,665
Open source, read every line
开源，每一行都可查看

32
00:02:09,665 --> 00:02:12,660
One key (OneKey), all yours
一把钥匙（OneKey），完全属于你

33
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:15,074
Hold it, sign it, go
握住它，签下它，出发

34
